CM_ SG_ 346 PEDAL_REQUEST "HIGH CONFIDENCE. Rogue bus 0 0x15A. 10-bit value is byte2<<2 | byte3>>6 (23|10@0+). About 3.14 times 0x1B6 byte 7 while engaged. Follows the driver pedal otherwise.";
CM_ SG_ 346 ENGAGED_STATE "Byte 1 equals 2 while engaged.";

