 SG_ ARMED : 39|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" XXX

CM_ SG_ 724 STATUS_BYTE0 "Rogue bus 1 0x2D4, about 50 Hz. Byte 0 is 0x80 while ICC is engaged.";
CM_ SG_ 724 ENGAGED "HIGH CONFIDENCE. Byte 0 bit 7 (0x80). ICC engaged.";
CM_ SG_ 724 STATUS_BYTE4 "Raw byte 4. Bit 7 is the armed candidate.";
CM_ SG_ 724 ARMED "PROVISIONAL. Byte 4 bit 7. Looks like armed or set speed stored. Stays set through the standstill release. Not a hold flag.";

